        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we now expect to transition away from using Corbin Wetcake for the production of our GAC products to a bituminous proven performance coal feedstock, which we believe can more effectively overcome design constraints.",
        "start_character": 18087,
        "end_character": 18316
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, after initial production runs, in December 2025, it became clear that ramp-up to nameplate capacity could not be accomplished without further modifications to the existing systems because of design flaws in our GAC Facility, on a standalone basis as well as in combination with the inherent variability of the Corbin Wetcake, which we planned to use to manufacture our GAC products.",
        "start_character": 17396,
        "end_character": 17787
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to offering AC and other chemical products, we work with customers as they develop and implement a compliance control strategy that utilizes our consumables solutions and that fits their unique operating and pollution control configuration.",
        "start_character": 5691,
        "end_character": 5943
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our domestic supply chain, including access to our vertically integrated lignite feedstock for our PAC and other products, provides our Company with a competitive advantage over certain other market participants.",
        "start_character": 12988,
        "end_character": 13216
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We conduct research and product development activities for further enhancement of our consumables.",
        "start_character": 18423,
        "end_character": 18521
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Among the risks are costs associated with operating manufacturing plants and mining operations, fines and penalties if we are found to be in violation of laws and regulations (and/or our operating permits), as well as modifications, disruptions or discontinuation of certain operations.",
        "start_character": 19126,
        "end_character": 19412
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Currently, the principal raw material we use in the manufacturing of AC is lignite coal, which is readily available through our 100% ownership of a lignite coal mine (the \"Five Forks Mine\") located in Saline, Louisiana.",
        "start_character": 13259,
        "end_character": 13478
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we are exploring uses for certain rare earth minerals and critical elements that can be isolated during the manufacturing process at our Corbin Facility for use in a variety of applications.",
        "start_character": 9749,
        "end_character": 9952
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we own and operate the Corbin Facility, where we process bituminous coal fines and apply patented technology to produce Corbin Wetcake.",
        "start_character": 16586,
        "end_character": 16734
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide regular performance and development meetings to encourage employees and managers to frequently discuss growth opportunities and provide a forum for honest feedback on performance and concerns.",
        "start_character": 34174,
        "end_character": 34390
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In late 2021, we developed a new CCP platform, FluxSorb RC, which is a treatment option in certain contaminated soil and groundwater remediation treatment sites.",
        "start_character": 8320,
        "end_character": 8481
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001515156-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001515156-26-000021-162eebbd52619355",
        "accession_number": "0001515156-26-000021",
